flowchart TD
    A[Four segment values] --> B[Calculate the mean]
    B --> C{Do the means match?}
    C -->|Yes| D[They appear to be one group]
    C -->|No| E[Record the magnitude difference first]
    D --> F[Add a shape token]
    F --> G{Do patterns split apart?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Review the mean and shape together]
    G -->|No| I[Check whether the mean is sufficient]
    H --> J[Separate next-action priorities]
